@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title AI - Search Products with AI Assistant

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|Customer|
start
note right
Precondition:
The customer is signed in.

Postcondition:
The question and the answer are stored in the customer's
session.
end note
:Open the AI assistant;
|System|
:Display the question box;
|Customer|
:Enter a question;
:Submit the question;
|System|
if (The system fails while processing the request?) then (Yes)
  :Return the system error;
  |Customer|
  :View the system error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Check the per-minute question limit;
if (There are more than 60 questions this minute?) then (Yes)
  :Return the rate-limit error;
  |Customer|
  :View the message;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Use the LLM and read-only tools (categories, product search, policies) to answer from real data;
:If the LLM cannot be used (no key, error, cooling down after 429, or over 20 questions a minute), answer with rules;
:Return the answer with the products found;
|Customer|
:View the answer and product cards;
stop

@enduml
